WEBVTT

00:11.017 --> 00:12.060
‎GRADE 2 CLASS 2

00:12.144 --> 00:15.272
‎So, we've decided on
<i>‎Aladdin and the Magic Lamp</i>‎.

00:15.355 --> 00:16.690
‎PLAY
‎ALADDIN, MOMOTARO, OPERA, ALICE

00:16.773 --> 00:18.108
‎-Yay!
‎-Wow!

00:18.191 --> 00:19.943
‎All right, who wants to be in the cast?

00:20.027 --> 00:21.319
‎GRADE 2 CLASS 2
‎CLASS REPRESENTATIVES

00:21.403 --> 00:22.404
‎EXCITED

00:22.487 --> 00:23.572
‎Right here!

00:24.156 --> 00:25.574
‎Glance.

00:25.657 --> 00:27.492
‎Glancing... Glance.

00:27.576 --> 00:28.577
‎WHOA

00:30.036 --> 00:31.705
‎No, no, no!

00:32.539 --> 00:33.540
‎Tch...

00:34.291 --> 00:35.584
‎BECKON

00:40.464 --> 00:41.465
‎Swish.

00:41.548 --> 00:42.966
‎OH...
‎WHOA...

00:43.592 --> 00:45.719
<i>‎Aw, I love you.</i>

00:45.802 --> 00:48.638
‎No, not like that, though.

00:50.307 --> 00:52.976
‎Can we finish without working
‎over summer break?

00:53.643 --> 00:56.480
‎Okay, let's work out everyone's schedules.

00:58.732 --> 01:01.234
‎Love how proactive they all are.

01:01.318 --> 01:02.486
‎HOMEROOM TEACHER

01:08.325 --> 01:10.368
<i>‎This distance between Hikawa and me...</i>

01:11.078 --> 01:13.997
<i>‎Seems like we get closer,
‎then drift apart...</i>

01:14.623 --> 01:16.124
<i>‎Am I just imagining it?</i>

01:16.708 --> 01:18.877
‎Might as well go all out on the backdrop.

01:20.962 --> 01:22.756
‎WAVE WAVE

01:23.757 --> 01:24.758
‎LOOKS AWAY

01:28.261 --> 01:29.262
<i>‎If I...</i>

01:30.514 --> 01:32.474
<i>‎just gave up completely,</i>

01:33.058 --> 01:34.476
<i>‎then nothing would happen</i>

01:34.976 --> 01:37.771
<i>‎and no one would get hurt.</i>

01:38.396 --> 01:41.399
<i>‎But I can't help wanting
‎to close this distance.</i>

01:42.400 --> 01:44.277
<i>‎Is that just selfish of me?</i>

01:46.488 --> 01:48.156
‎NINE MOMOKA - CAN'T WAIT
‎FOR THE CONCERT TOMORROW!

01:48.240 --> 01:50.367
<i>‎Can't wait for the concert tomorrow!</i>
